<title>SWITZERLAND: Rieter boosts 1996 net, plans to cut share capital.</title>
<headline>Rieter boosts 1996 net, plans to cut share capital.</headline>
<dateline>WINTERTHUR, Switzerland 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rieter Holding AG said net profit would rise in 1996 despite restructuring costs and operating income would rise substantially.</p>
<p>It gave no more details in a statement.</p>
<p>It also said it planned to reduce its share capital by around 10 percent and announce details at a later date. &quot;This action will increase earnings per share accordingly.&quot;</p>
</text>
